{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cd6a2d8f70eaf9f7b831ceef9689a54649c654561c82bed05d739ab3b837f35e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51096a9def36c602a95cf659cd82c8c44bc2c59fd8aeecb81f9220716bdaa8a4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03a90d2d2d50df54a82c7da30fa92b6aeac63c1f73959772af6f5eb3b00885c5",
      "text": "昨天碰头会上说的访谈环节的\n准备，好像搞定得差不多啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a49aed8c3546746d7a9eab999ec05dc69a9dfab816226b499a2e082a137e43d6",
      "text": "好快啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4add220f6fc797d449172bf1c8fe31fa9e0336cffe9ae4f6c9642c17cbed8c4c",
      "text": "看起来很顺利呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c257aa8771442d748e1cad4437884edf6f504e8721808c0c40ed0a5d0a25d7",
      "text": "介绍前辈们的事，\n大家马上就同意了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:951241f50946aef3abff571188a41f96b3722176309699cfba30a5f839c3a2e8",
      "text": "可是，我说也展示一下回忆的照片时，\n旬亲却死活都不答应……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:540eda73184c354f1218b94e0dc7433c875666debbd7051e265b36cb473702a0",
      "text": "我本想着给大家看看录音休息时\n每个人放松的样子嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7db700ea4c8b867d95cb1ea832951bf09fcb3ac71075eaf41f0fd65de3d28326",
      "text": "我明明拍了一张旬亲休息时的\n珍藏照片的说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75c32331f0b5b4976bb3781e2b9383143cf272230765f26a2de89af7d3a01c88",
      "text": "不过那张被驳回了，所以换成了大家聚在一起聊天的照片！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c260e454f19e2a37ede75c66a37486291650a851b09ad68a983b25d9406ebaf5",
      "text": "不过不过，这张照片也是Mega耀眼的1张哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:075e609d692f57071bdcd5f77faa7a2fd4f6cb0a36fa39d03ac8917bf95cf36a",
      "text": "感觉就是纯正的花絮照，能很好地传达出我们平时的氛围！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48e969e9dfcf618cf67952273cb32d530e17f93486f42eccfdb3bf993e2f9e78",
      "text": "围绕这张照片的幕后故事也有很多，得在录制前好好整理出来才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_b:2_4_024_02_09_b:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f8696fc340c7c4f074ce4ceab5e738f2fe5abf1f0fb2480dc86a4d0cb38fec6",
      "text": "所以说制作人酱，\n下次的录制也拜托你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
